 NoOrYesWithBigFont;myGuiParms;parms
⍝ "No-or-Yes" dialog with a big font
 myGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.(fontStandard fontInput)←2⍴⎕NEW'Font'(('PName' 'Courier New')('Size' 24))

 ⎕←myGuiParms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.NoOrYes'Are you really sure about this?'
